"""Opt-in overlap replacement ahead of the existing separator dispatcher.

Only closed Bundles whose original inner curbs overlap use the union branch.
All other declarations use the existing dispatcher, with unchanged inputs and
outputs when no union is needed. The caller retains the full ownership registry.
"""
